{"id":"fb6796e83e0c5ef4","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md","title":"Integral Singular Chains and Cochains","display":"df-singular-chain-cochain-data — Integral Singular Chains and Cochains","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data","aliases":["58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data"],"display":"df-singular-chain-cochain-data — Integral Singular Chains and Cochains","depends_on":["[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-singular-chain-cochain-data — Integral Singular Chains and Cochains"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau,\\upsilon\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau,\\upsilon\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。所有带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau,n)\">\\((X,\\tau,n)\\)</span> 的函数仅在这些类型下使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^r\">\\(\\mathbb R^r\\)</span> 使用以有限序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 为定义域的函数编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_r\">\\(\\Delta_r\\)</span> 是下式给出的标准单形，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\Delta_r}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\Delta_r,r+1)\">\\(\\tau_{\\Delta_r}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\Delta_r,r+1)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(r,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(r,v)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega\">\\(r\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(a\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:a\\to r+1\">\\(v:a\\to r+1\\)</span> 严格递增；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\operatorname{dom}v\">\\(a=\\operatorname{dom}v\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(c)=\\{s\\in\\operatorname{dom}c:c(s)\\neq0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(c)=\\{s\\in\\operatorname{dom}c:c(s)\\neq0\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}\">\\(\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}\\)</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 当公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 成立，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg P\">\\(\\neg P\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>为压缩重复的参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n=S_n(X,\\tau)\">\\(S_n=S_n(X,\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n=C_n(X,\\tau)\">\\(C_n=C_n(X,\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^n=C^n(X,\\tau)\">\\(C^n=C^n(X,\\tau)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0_A=\\{\\langle a,0\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\">\\(\\mathbf0_A=\\{\\langle a,0\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\)</span>。各处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum\">\\(\\sum\\)</span> 为有限整数和，空和为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>链、上链及其商类分别保持不同的函数域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[c]^{\\mathrm h}_n\">\\([c]^{\\mathrm h}_n\\)</span> 仅对闭链定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[u]^{\\mathrm c}_n\">\\([u]^{\\mathrm c}_n\\)</span> 仅对上闭链定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularCycle}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularCycle}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega\\to\\Delta_r\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{r+1}:(\\forall i\\in r+1\\;x(i)\\geq0)\\land\\sum_{i\\in r+1}x(i)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r\\in\\omega\\to\\Delta_r\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{r+1}:(\\forall i\\in r+1\\;x(i)\\geq0)\\land\\sum_{i\\in r+1}x(i)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(r,v)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,\\left\\{\\left\\langle j,\\sum_{i\\in a}t(i)\\mathbf1_{\\{j=v(i)\\}}\\right\\rangle:j\\in r+1\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_{a-1}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(r,v)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,\\left\\{\\left\\langle j,\\sum_{i\\in a}t(i)\\mathbf1_{\\{j=v(i)\\}}\\right\\rangle:j\\in r+1\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_{a-1}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nr\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land i\\in r+1\\to\n\\delta_{r,i}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S\\!\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle j,j\\rangle:j\\in i\\}\\cup\\{\\langle j,j+1\\rangle:j\\in r\\setminus i\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nr\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land i\\in r+1\\to\n\\delta_{r,i}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S\\!\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle j,j\\rangle:j\\in i\\}\\cup\\{\\langle j,j+1\\rangle:j\\in r\\setminus i\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{s\\in X^{\\Delta_n}:\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(s,\\Delta_n,\\tau_{\\Delta_n},X,\\tau)\\},&amp;n\\in\\omega,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;n\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\omega.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{s\\in X^{\\Delta_n}:\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(s,\\Delta_n,\\tau_{\\Delta_n},X,\\tau)\\},&amp;n\\in\\omega,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;n\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\omega.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in\\mathbb Z^{S_n(X,\\tau)}:|\\operatorname{supp}(c)|&lt;\\omega\\},\n\\qquad C^n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\mathbb Z^{S_n(X,\\tau)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in\\mathbb Z^{S_n(X,\\tau)}:|\\operatorname{supp}(c)|&lt;\\omega\\},\n\\qquad C^n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\mathbb Z^{S_n(X,\\tau)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularChainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle c,c&#39;\\rangle,\\{\\langle s,c(s)+c&#39;(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}\\rangle:c,c&#39;\\in C_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle u,u&#39;\\rangle,\\{\\langle s,u(s)+u&#39;(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}\\rangle:u,u&#39;\\in C^n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularChainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle c,c&#39;\\rangle,\\{\\langle s,c(s)+c&#39;(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}\\rangle:c,c&#39;\\in C_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle u,u&#39;\\rangle,\\{\\langle s,u(s)+u&#39;(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}\\rangle:u,u&#39;\\in C^n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle c,\\left\\{\\left\\langle s,\n\\sum_{q\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}\\sum_{i\\in n+1}(-1)^i c(q)\\mathbf1_{\\{s=q\\circ\\delta_{n,i}\\}}\n\\right\\rangle:s\\in S_{n-1}\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:c\\in C_n\\right\\},&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\{\\langle c,\\mathbf0_{S_{n-1}}\\rangle:c\\in C_n\\},&amp;n\\leq0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle c,\\left\\{\\left\\langle s,\n\\sum_{q\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}\\sum_{i\\in n+1}(-1)^i c(q)\\mathbf1_{\\{s=q\\circ\\delta_{n,i}\\}}\n\\right\\rangle:s\\in S_{n-1}\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:c\\in C_n\\right\\},&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\{\\langle c,\\mathbf0_{S_{n-1}}\\rangle:c\\in C_n\\},&amp;n\\leq0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle u,\\left\\{\\left\\langle q,\n\\sum_{i\\in n+2}(-1)^i u(q\\circ\\delta_{n+1,i})\n\\right\\rangle:q\\in S_{n+1}\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:u\\in C^n\\right\\},&amp;n\\in\\omega,\\\\\n\\{\\langle u,\\mathbf0_{S_{n+1}}\\rangle:u\\in C^n\\},&amp;n&lt;0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle u,\\left\\{\\left\\langle q,\n\\sum_{i\\in n+2}(-1)^i u(q\\circ\\delta_{n+1,i})\n\\right\\rangle:q\\in S_{n+1}\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:u\\in C^n\\right\\},&amp;n\\in\\omega,\\\\\n\\{\\langle u,\\mathbf0_{S_{n+1}}\\rangle:u\\in C^n\\},&amp;n&lt;0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land c\\in C_n\n\\land\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)(c)=\\mathbf0_{S_{n-1}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land u\\in C^n\n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)(u)=\\mathbf0_{S_{n+1}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land c\\in C_n\n\\land\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)(c)=\\mathbf0_{S_{n-1}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land u\\in C^n\n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)(u)=\\mathbf0_{S_{n+1}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\to\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\{\\langle s,c(s)+\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n+1)(b)(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}:b\\in C_{n+1}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\to\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\{\\langle s,u(s)+\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n-1)(v)(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}:v\\in C^{n-1}\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\to\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\{\\langle s,c(s)+\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n+1)(b)(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}:b\\in C_{n+1}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\to\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\{\\langle s,u(s)+\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n-1)(v)(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}:v\\in C^{n-1}\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IntegralSingularHomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}:c\\in C_n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntegralSingularCohomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}:u\\in C^n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IntegralSingularHomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}:c\\in C_n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntegralSingularCohomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}:u\\in C^n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularHomologyAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n},[c&#39;]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularChainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)(\\langle c,c&#39;\\rangle)]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c&#39;,X,\\tau,n)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n},[u&#39;]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)(\\langle u,u&#39;\\rangle)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u&#39;,X,\\tau,n)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularHomologyAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n},[c&#39;]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularChainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)(\\langle c,c&#39;\\rangle)]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c&#39;,X,\\tau,n)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n},[u&#39;]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)(\\langle u,u&#39;\\rangle)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u&#39;,X,\\tau,n)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularChainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle c,\\left\\{\\left\\langle q,\n\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)\\mathbf1_{\\{q=f\\circ s\\}}\\right\\rangle:q\\in S_n(Y,\\upsilon)\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:c\\in C_n(X,\\tau)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularChainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle c,\\left\\{\\left\\langle q,\n\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)\\mathbf1_{\\{q=f\\circ s\\}}\\right\\rangle:q\\in S_n(Y,\\upsilon)\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:c\\in C_n(X,\\tau)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle u,\\{\\langle s,u(f\\circ s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\}\\rangle:u\\in C^n(Y,\\upsilon)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle u,\\{\\langle s,u(f\\circ s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\}\\rangle:u\\in C^n(Y,\\upsilon)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularHomologyPushforward}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n},\n[\\mathrm{SingularChainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)(c)]^{\\mathrm h}_{Y,\\upsilon,n}\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{Y,\\upsilon,n},\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)(u)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularHomologyPushforward}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n},\n[\\mathrm{SingularChainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)(c)]^{\\mathrm h}_{Y,\\upsilon,n}\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{Y,\\upsilon,n},\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)(u)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na,b\\in\\omega\\land u\\in C^a(X,\\tau)\\land v\\in C^b(X,\\tau)\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainCup}_S(u,v,X,\\tau,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle s,\nu\\!\\left(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle:i\\in a+1\\})\\right)\nv\\!\\left(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle j,a+j\\rangle:j\\in b+1\\})\\right)\n\\bigr\\rangle:s\\in S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na,b\\in\\omega\\land u\\in C^a(X,\\tau)\\land v\\in C^b(X,\\tau)\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainCup}_S(u,v,X,\\tau,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle s,\nu\\!\\left(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle:i\\in a+1\\})\\right)\nv\\!\\left(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle j,a+j\\rangle:j\\in b+1\\})\\right)\n\\bigr\\rangle:s\\in S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na,b\\in\\omega\\to\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyCup}_S(X,\\tau,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,a},[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,b}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainCup}_S(u,v,X,\\tau,a,b)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,a+b}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,a)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(v,X,\\tau,b)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na,b\\in\\omega\\to\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyCup}_S(X,\\tau,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,a},[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,b}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainCup}_S(u,v,X,\\tau,a,b)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,a+b}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,a)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(v,X,\\tau,b)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n},[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)u(s)\\right\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n},[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)u(s)\\right\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}_S(z,p,a,q,b,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land a,b\\in\\mathrm{IntegralSingularHomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists c\\in a\\;\\exists d\\in b\\;\nz=[\\{\\langle s,p\\,c(s)+q\\,d(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\}]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}_S(z,p,a,q,b,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land a,b\\in\\mathrm{IntegralSingularHomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists c\\in a\\;\\exists d\\in b\\;\nz=[\\{\\langle s,p\\,c(s)+q\\,d(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\}]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(a,\\ell,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\ell,[0,1],\\{U\\cap[0,1]:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\},X,\\tau)\n\\land\\ell(0)=\\ell(1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s\\in S_1(X,\\tau)\\;\n\\left(s=\\{\\langle t,\\ell(t(1))\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_1\\}\n\\land a=[\\{\\langle u,\\mathbf1_{\\{u=s\\}}\\rangle:u\\in S_1(X,\\tau)\\}]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,1}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(a,\\ell,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\ell,[0,1],\\{U\\cap[0,1]:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\},X,\\tau)\n\\land\\ell(0)=\\ell(1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s\\in S_1(X,\\tau)\\;\n\\left(s=\\{\\langle t,\\ell(t(1))\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_1\\}\n\\land a=[\\{\\langle u,\\mathbf1_{\\{u=s\\}}\\rangle:u\\in S_1(X,\\tau)\\}]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,1}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件补齐原 Chern 类、手术粘合及杯积文字实际需要而通用上链复形文件没有构造的奇异单形、面映射及整数（上）链数据。</li>\n<li>同调／上同调对象是陪集的集合。推前、拉回、杯积与配对均给出代表元上的函数图，不通过任意选择的 “诱导映射” 占位谓词取得。</li>\n<li>负次数采用零群，次数零的边界采用未增广约定。奇异链只允许有限支撑，上链不作有限支撑限制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Continuous}$ 取 [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\tau,\\upsilon\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\Delta_r}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\Delta_r,r+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(r,v)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v:a\\to r+1","display":false},{"tex":"a=\\operatorname{dom}v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(c)=\\{s\\in\\operatorname{dom}c:c(s)\\neq0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg P","display":false},{"tex":"S_n=S_n(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"C_n=C_n(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"C^n=C^n(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0_A=\\{\\langle a,0\\rangle:a\\in A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"[c]^{\\mathrm h}_n","display":false},{"tex":"[u]^{\\mathrm c}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;(x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SingularCycle}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\omega\\to\\Delta_r\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{r+1}:(\\forall i\\in r+1\\;x(i)\\geq0)\\land\\sum_{i\\in r+1}x(i)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(r,v)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,\\left\\{\\left\\langle j,\\sum_{i\\in a}t(i)\\mathbf1_{\\{j=v(i)\\}}\\right\\rangle:j\\in r+1\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_{a-1}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nr\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land i\\in r+1\\to\n\\delta_{r,i}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S\\!\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle j,j\\rangle:j\\in i\\}\\cup\\{\\langle j,j+1\\rangle:j\\in r\\setminus i\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S_n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{s\\in X^{\\Delta_n}:\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(s,\\Delta_n,\\tau_{\\Delta_n},X,\\tau)\\},&n\\in\\omega,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&n\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\omega.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"C_n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in\\mathbb Z^{S_n(X,\\tau)}:|\\operatorname{supp}(c)|<\\omega\\},\n\\qquad C^n(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\mathbb Z^{S_n(X,\\tau)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularChainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle c,c'\\rangle,\\{\\langle s,c(s)+c'(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}\\rangle:c,c'\\in C_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle u,u'\\rangle,\\{\\langle s,u(s)+u'(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}\\rangle:u,u'\\in C^n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle c,\\left\\{\\left\\langle s,\n\\sum_{q\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}\\sum_{i\\in n+1}(-1)^i c(q)\\mathbf1_{\\{s=q\\circ\\delta_{n,i}\\}}\n\\right\\rangle:s\\in S_{n-1}\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:c\\in C_n\\right\\},&n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\{\\langle c,\\mathbf0_{S_{n-1}}\\rangle:c\\in C_n\\},&n\\leq0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle u,\\left\\{\\left\\langle q,\n\\sum_{i\\in n+2}(-1)^i u(q\\circ\\delta_{n+1,i})\n\\right\\rangle:q\\in S_{n+1}\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:u\\in C^n\\right\\},&n\\in\\omega,\\\\\n\\{\\langle u,\\mathbf0_{S_{n+1}}\\rangle:u\\in C^n\\},&n<0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land c\\in C_n\n\\land\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)(c)=\\mathbf0_{S_{n-1}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land u\\in C^n\n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n)(u)=\\mathbf0_{S_{n+1}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\to\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\{\\langle s,c(s)+\\mathrm{SingularBoundary}_S(X,\\tau,n+1)(b)(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}:b\\in C_{n+1}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\to\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\{\\langle s,u(s)+\\mathrm{SingularCoboundary}_S(X,\\tau,n-1)(v)(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n\\}:v\\in C^{n-1}\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IntegralSingularHomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}:c\\in C_n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntegralSingularCohomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}:u\\in C^n\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularHomologyAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n},[c']^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularChainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)(\\langle c,c'\\rangle)]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c',X,\\tau,n)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n},[u']^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainAddition}_S(X,\\tau,n)(\\langle u,u'\\rangle)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u',X,\\tau,n)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularChainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle c,\\left\\{\\left\\langle q,\n\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)\\mathbf1_{\\{q=f\\circ s\\}}\\right\\rangle:q\\in S_n(Y,\\upsilon)\\right\\}\\right\\rangle:c\\in C_n(X,\\tau)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle u,\\{\\langle s,u(f\\circ s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\}\\rangle:u\\in C^n(Y,\\upsilon)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularHomologyPushforward}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n},\n[\\mathrm{SingularChainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)(c)]^{\\mathrm h}_{Y,\\upsilon,n}\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{Y,\\upsilon,n},\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon,n)(u)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,Y,\\upsilon,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na,b\\in\\omega\\land u\\in C^a(X,\\tau)\\land v\\in C^b(X,\\tau)\\to\n\\mathrm{SingularCochainCup}_S(u,v,X,\\tau,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle s,\nu\\!\\left(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle:i\\in a+1\\})\\right)\nv\\!\\left(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle j,a+j\\rangle:j\\in b+1\\})\\right)\n\\bigr\\rangle:s\\in S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na,b\\in\\omega\\to\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyCup}_S(X,\\tau,a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,a},[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,b}\\rangle,\n[\\mathrm{SingularCochainCup}_S(u,v,X,\\tau,a,b)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,a+b}\\bigr\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,a)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(v,X,\\tau,b)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,n},[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}\\rangle,\n\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)u(s)\\right\\rangle:\n\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(u,X,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathrm{SingularCycle}_S(c,X,\\tau,n)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}_S(z,p,a,q,b,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land a,b\\in\\mathrm{IntegralSingularHomology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists c\\in a\\;\\exists d\\in b\\;\nz=[\\{\\langle s,p\\,c(s)+q\\,d(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\}]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,n}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(a,\\ell,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\ell,[0,1],\\{U\\cap[0,1]:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\},X,\\tau)\n\\land\\ell(0)=\\ell(1)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists s\\in S_1(X,\\tau)\\;\n\\left(s=\\{\\langle t,\\ell(t(1))\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_1\\}\n\\land a=[\\{\\langle u,\\mathbf1_{\\{u=s\\}}\\rangle:u\\in S_1(X,\\tau)\\}]^{\\mathrm h}_{X,\\tau,1}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":9477,"backlinks":[{"id":"213ce75a48289483","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AffineFace}$、$\\mathrm{IntegralSingularCohomology}$、$\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}$、$\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyAddition}$、$\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyCup}$、$\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}$ 取 [[58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"e5fc9ff70d8260ec","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$v_0=\\langle1,1,1\\rangle_3$，$v_1=\\langle-1,1,-1\\rangle_3$，$v_2=\\langle1,-1,-1\\rangle_3$，$v_3=\\langle-1,-1,1\\rangle_3